---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Teardown Methodology | Vyaparnama">
  <div class="px-6 sm:px-12 pt-32 pb-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#FF4D00] block mb-3">Field Process</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight">The Teardown Audit.</h1>
      <p class="text-white/60 text-base font-light mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Why do thousands of merchants watch Vyaparnama? Because we don't shoot generic promotional videos. We explain how money and machinery work together.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="border-l-2 border-[#FF4D00]/40 pl-6 sm:pl-10 space-y-16">
      
      <div class="relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[47px] top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4D00] shadow-[0_0_12px_#FF4D00]"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Step 01</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white mb-2">Raw Material Verification</h2>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Where does the cotton, steel, seed, or resin originate? We inspect delivery challans and verify purity or grade specifications straight on the scale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[47px] top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4D00] shadow-[0_0_12px_#FF4D00]"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Step 02</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white mb-2">Machine Run Cycle Breakdown</h2>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          We film actual speed, reject rates, maintenance cycles, and output efficiency. When a buyer watches this, they understand why the price point is justified.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[47px] top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4D00] shadow-[0_0_12px_#FF4D00]"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Step 03</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white mb-2">Packaging & Batch Traceability</h2>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          How is it packed for freight? We film sealing, weighing, carton grading, and pallet loading ready for highway transit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[47px] top-1 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4D00] shadow-[0_0_12px_#FF4D00]"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Step 04</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white mb-2">Direct Founder Q&A</h2>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Clear, straightforward numbers on minimum order quantities (MOQ), wholesale discounts, delivery lead times, and payment terms.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#FF4D00]/10 border border-[#FF4D00]/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Ready for our crew to visit your setup?</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-light mt-1">We schedule visits across industrial clusters weekly.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#FF4D00] text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-[#e04400] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap">
        Schedule Unit Audit →
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>